  "description": "FANBAZ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H92 Dy4 N16 O28,3.5(C1 H2 Cl2),0.5(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.822-3.877 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 107.26-112.92°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(HL3−)4(MeOH)4]2·7CH2Cl2·MeOH.",
